12. (1) The Chief Secretary to the Government shall prepare

the Government Service Efficiency Commitment Report every

three years, which shall contain the following information:

(a) overall effectiveness of Government service delivery;

(b) regulatory burden reduction performance;

(c) details of Government entity ratings;

(d) details of incentives given to the Government entities

that achieve rating targets;

(e) service performance reports of State Government entities;

and

(f) any other relevant information.

(2) The Minister shall cause the Government Service Efficiency

Commitment Report made under subsection (1) to be laid before

the Dewan Rakyat as soon as may be practicable.

Exemption
